00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:35.190
There are identical footprints on both of our hearts.

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:35.190
onaji ashi ato

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:37.800
zutto mae kara

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:42.850
I had unconciously liked you for a long while now.

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:39.560
kizukazu ni

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:42.850
suki ni natta

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:45.140
