00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:49.980
My feelings were hiding in the days we spent, full of passion.

00:23:45.140 --> 00:23:49.980
tsukihi ni kakureteta

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:52.570
zutto mae kara

00:23:49.980 --> 00:23:57.660
We've been drawn to each other for so long now.

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.450
otagai ni

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:57.660
hikareteita

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:59.870
kono kimochi wa

00:23:57.660 --> 00:24:06.870
This feeling I have for you is what youth left behind.

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:06.870
seishun no wasuremono

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:14.990
Preview

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:14.990
Preview

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.220
The roster's getting expanded!

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:15.760
I can't wait to meet the guys from the Bats again.

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:16.580
What?

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:19.940
Kellogg's retiring when he just got promoted?

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:21.720
Why would he?

00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:24.650
Next time, on Major: That's Not Like You!

00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:26.920
Run toward the stage of your dreams!

